        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellLeft" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>施設統括：施設管理者　［氏名］</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellCenter"><text:p>指揮班</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellLeft"><text:p>班長：［役職］　［氏名］</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellLeft"><text:p>班員：［役職］　［氏名］</text:p><text:p>班員：［役職］　［氏名］</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellCenter"><text:p>情報収集班</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellLeft"><text:p>班長：［役職］　［氏名］</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="c2_CellLeft"><text:p>班員：［役職］　［氏名］</text:p><text:p>班員：［役職］　［氏名］</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
